# Third-party notices - Heart of Magic Librarian, Chalkboard design @PROJECT_VERSION@

The design's own files are MIT, like Heart of Magic Librarian (`@DESIGN_LICENSE_FILE@` next to this file), apart from the parts below.

### The chalk fonts - SIL Open Font License 1.1

The `.ttf` files under `PrismaUI/views/SpellLearning/SpellLearningPanel/themes/chalkboard/fonts/` are subsets of
open fonts under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Google Fonts families, LXGW Xiaolai, and Hakgyoansim Bunpil by
KERIS, designed by Yoon Design). Each font's license sits next to it (`<Family>-OFL.txt`, and
`HakgyoansimBunpil-LICENSE.txt` for the KERIS font), and the `README.txt` in that folder names every file's source
font and license.

### Panel icons from game-icons.net - CC BY 3.0

The 19 icons in `PrismaUI/views/SpellLearning/SpellLearningPanel/themes/chalkboard/icons/` are shapes from
game-icons.net (<https://game-icons.net>) by Delapouite and Lorc, licensed CC BY 3.0
(<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/>), redrawn as chalk drawings for Heart of Magic. Each icon's source
